iv class="layout58_image-wrapper"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"/><img src="/assets/images/final/nogomet-20i-20rukomet.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/nogomet-20i-20rukomet-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/nogomet-20i-20rukomet.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 77vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 70vw, 31vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div><div id="w-node-e784e20a-f6d5-92f1-1926-d914ba865a6b-4f53d669" class="layout58_content"><div class="text-size-large-2">I sport u Bujama je prosperirao od Digitrona pa su tako postojali nogometni klub Digitron i rukometni klub Digitron s muškom i ženskom ekipom, a uz redovne aktivnosti u radničkim sportskim susretima pomagalo se streljaštvo i šah.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component image-right"><div id="w-node-c5cb8d6b-87e0-a2c7-c8e6-70e386085d7e-4f53d669" class="layout58_content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium">Digitron i košarka<br/></h3></div><div class="text-size-large-2"><br/>Digitron je od 1968. do 1975. bio sponzor izbora za najboljeg košarkaša Jugoslavije u organizaciji Sportskih novosti. Trofej Digitron dobili su Đ†osić, dva puta, a po jednom Skansi, Plećaš, Šolman, Kićanović i Gjergja. </div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><h3 class="heading-medium heading-duplicated">Digitron i košarka<br/></h3><div class="featured-image-group image-group-mobile-bigger"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="image-background"/><img src="/assets/images/final/digitron-20i-20kos-cc-8carka-201.2.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/digitron-20i-20kos-cc-8carka-201.2-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/digitron-20i-20kos-cc-8carka-201.2.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 84vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 70vw, 33vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"/><img src="/assets/images/final/digitron-20i-20kos-cc-8carka-201.2.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/digitron-20i-20kos-cc-8carka-201.2-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/digitron-20i-20kos-cc-8carka-201.2.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 77vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 70vw, 31vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div><div id="w-node-d5b11500-9f22-5e53-95aa-fc639b32d26e-4f53d669" class="layout58_content"><div class="text-size-large-2